  "question": {
    "text": "Let a vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> has a magnitude <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math>. Let a vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> be such that for every <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfenced></math>, the vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is perpendicular to the vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
